~ start
.
=> END

# ==========================================================
#           Looping
# ==========================================================
~ first_loop
Adrian: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.LEFT, "adrian_calm")] W-what just happened? Did I... go back to this morning? I need to fix all of this.
=> END

~ second_loop
Adrian: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.LEFT, "adrian_angry")] No... Not again...
=> END

~ third_loop
Adrian: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.LEFT, "adrian_angry")] Ugh... I'm never going to get used to this...
=> END

# ==========================================================
#           Cook Phase
# ==========================================================
~ still_cooking
Elena: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.RIGHT, "elena_calm")] Good morning, darling! I'm making breakfast. It'll be ready soon.
=> END

~ after_cooking
Elena:  [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.RIGHT, "elena_calm")] Good morning, darling! Finally, you're awake. Come on, let's have breakfast.
=> END

~ finish_cooking
Elena: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.RIGHT, "elena_calm")] Hey, darling! Breakfast is ready. Come eat with me!
=> END

~ still_inside_bedroom
Elena: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.RIGHT, "elena_calm")] Darling? Are you awake?
Elena: I've been waiting for you. Breakfast is getting cold.
=> END

# ==========================================================
#           Eat Phase
# ==========================================================
~ done_eating
Elena: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.RIGHT, "elena_calm")] Oh, by the way, Maya asked me to go out with her today.
Adrian: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.LEFT, "adrian_calm")] Oh? You two have plans?
Elena: Yeah. She said she wanted to hang out for a bit.
Adrian: Sounds nice. What time are you going?
Elena: Probably around 12 P.M. I shouldn't be out too late, though.
Adrian: Alright then. Have fun with her.
Elena: I will. 
=> END

~ not_eating
Elena: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.RIGHT, "elena_calm")] You're not eating, darling?
Adrian: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.LEFT, "adrian_calm")] I'm not really hungry yet.
Elena: You should at least have something. I don't want you skipping breakfast.
Adrian: I'll eat in a bit. Don't worry.
Elena: Alright, but don't wait too long.
Elena: Oh, by the way, Maya asked me to go out with her today.
Adrian: Oh? You two have plans?
Elena: Yeah. She wanted to hang out for a bit.
Adrian: Sounds nice. What time are you going?
Elena: Probably around 12 P.M. I shouldn't be out too late, though.
Adrian: Alright then. Have fun with her.
Elena: I will.
=> END

# ==========================================================
#           Shower Phase
# ==========================================================
~ going_to_shower
Elena: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.RIGHT, "elena_calm")] I'm gonna take a shower. See you in a bit, darling.
=> END

# ==========================================================
#           Ready Phase
# ==========================================================
~ heading_out
Elena: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.RIGHT, "elena_calm")] I'm heading out now, love. See you later.
Adrian: [do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.LEFT, "adrian_calm")] Okay. Be careful.
Elena: I will. Love you.
Adrian: Love you too.
=> END








~ talk
[do! show_sprite(DialogueView.ViewPosition.RIGHT, "elena_calm")].
Elena: Yes dear?
- I love you
	Adrian: I love you.
